Package: rust-v
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Matthias Hryniszak <padcom@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= @GLIBC@), libgcc-s1, libasound2t64 | libasound2
Recommends: curl
Suggests: libvirglrenderer1
Section: otherosfs
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/padcom/rust-v
Description: RISC-V RVA23 system emulator
 Emulates a 4-core RISC-V RVA23 machine with virtio disk, network, display, input, sound
 and clipboard, fast enough to run Ubuntu and Debian. `rust-v ubuntu` and `rust-v debian`
 download a distribution image once and boot it. The bundled OpenSBI and U-Boot firmware
 is installed in /usr/share/rust-v/firmware.
